What is OCP ORV3 Power Supply?
OCP ORV3 power supply represents the latest evolution in server power delivery systems, developed under the Open Compute Project's rigorous specifications. These modular, high-density power supplies feature digital management capabilities and energy efficiencies exceeding 92%, making them ideal for modern rack-mounted server architectures. The ORV3 standard enables direct installation in server racks or as side-mounted power modules, offering significant advantages in space utilization and thermal management compared to traditional power supplies.
